          <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Himalayan Pink Rock Salt</h3>
          <p class="font-body-md text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Ancient crystalline mineral salt containing 84+ essential trace elements. Accentuates natural sweetness
