          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-medium">
          <span>Digestive Health</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">Enzyme Supporting</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Side-by-Side Comparison: Traditional Mithai vs Nutri Burfi -->
  <section class="max-w-max-width mx-auto mb-16 sm:mb-24">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-14 border border-secondary/10">
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-display-lg text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-headline-xl text-on-surface font-bold">The Nutritional
          Distinction</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2">See how our clean-label formulation elevates
          functional sweets compared to traditional confectioneries.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse min-w-[540px]">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-secondary/20 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">
              <th class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold">Nutritional Metric</th>
              <th class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold text-red-600">Traditional Sweets</th>
              <th class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-white/60 rounded-t-xl">Nutri Burfi Standard</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-secondary/10 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <tr>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-medium text-on-surface">Protein per Serving</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 text-on-surface-variant">2g – 3g (Low)</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-white/60">15g – 20g (High Bioavailability)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-medium text-on-surface">Sweetener Source</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 text-on-surface-variant">Refined White Sugar / Corn Syrup</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-white/60">100% Whole Medjool Dates</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-medium text-on-surface">Glycemic Response</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 text-on-surface-variant">Rapid Blood Sugar Spikes & Crashes</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-white/60">Sustained, Balanced Energy Release</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-medium text-on-surface">Added Preservatives</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 text-on-surface-variant">Artificial Flavors & Colorants</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-white/60">Zero Artificial Preservatives</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-medium text-on-surface">Dietary Compatibility</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 text-on-surface-variant">High Carb / High Sugar</td>
              <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-emerald-800 bg-white/60 rounded-b-xl">Fitness, Keto-Friendly,
                Vegetarian</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Call to Action Banner -->
  <section class="max-w-max-width mx-auto">
    <div
