      <div class="max-w-xl space-y-3">
        <span class="font-label-md text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-blue font-semibold">Experience The
          Difference</span>
        <h2 class="font-display-lg text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white font-bold leading-tight">Ready to taste
          functional luxury?</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base text-white/80">
          Explore our signature collection of protein burfis and performance bars, handcrafted fresh in every batch.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
        <a href="/products"
          class="bg-white text-ink-black px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-white/90 active:scale-95 transition-all text-center shadow-lg">
